{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6414","title":"Xiaomi 11.11 Mega Sale and Black Friday: Discover More with Exciting Offers","desc":"Xiaomi announced Xiaomi 11.11 Mega Sale, with Black Friday promotions set to follow later in the shopping season.","view_cnt":"197","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1792999819","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/860_operatorx_operatorx_opx/26/10/2026/9b9f0de1e4f852d8af43bfba6511f0e1.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, October 27, 2026 \u003c/strong\u003e– Xiaomi announced Xiaomi 11.11 Mega Sale, with Black Friday promotions set to follow later in the shopping season, bringing a wide range of exciting deals on popular products across participating markets. As promotional activities roll out across participating markets,¹ consumers in participating markets will have opportunities to upgrade their devices and explore attractive offers, from smartphones and wearables to home entertainment and smart appliances.² Through the campaigns, Xiaomi invites more consumers to discover and experience products across Xiaomi's \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/770_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/10/2026/b483ee1f397195dcc2dd9a206aebb52e.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAmong the smartphone highlights of this year's campaigns are Xiaomi 17T Pro, REDMI Note 17 Pro Max 5G, and POCO X8 Pro, offering consumers a range of options to suit different needs. Xiaomi 17T Pro brings moments to life with Leica Live Moment, while REDMI Note 17 Pro Max 5G features a massive 10,000mAh battery, delivering long-lasting power for everyday use. POCO X8 Pro also joins the promotional lineup, offering flagship-level performance with exceptional value. For wearables, Xiaomi Watch S5 46mm is another featured pick.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBeyond smartphones and wearables, this year's promotions also feature a selection of products designed to bring more immersive home entertainment, greater convenience to everyday household routines, and smarter personal mobility. Featured products include Xiaomi TV S Mini LED 98 2026, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum 6, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Ultra, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 10kg, and Mijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThroughout Xiaomi 11.11 Mega Sale and Black Friday campaigns, participating markets will offer a selection of promotional deals tailored to local consumers. Specific offers, eligible products, and campaign periods may vary by market.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eConsumers can explore available offers through Xiaomi's official website, participating e-commerce platforms such as Amazon, Shopee, and Lazada, Xiaomi official TikTok Shop, and local authorized partners,³ depending on local availability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFor full campaign details, including promotional dates, product availability, and purchasing options, please visit \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com\"\u003eXiaomi's official website\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ Starting dates differ across markets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Product participation, specifications, and configurations may vary by market. Not all featured products are included in promotional offers in every market. Please refer to local Xiaomi websites for details.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ Sales partners vary by market. Please refer to local information for sales availability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2026, the MAU reached 766.5 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of June 30, 2026, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,160.8 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 800,000 units by September 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"3","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1793070032"},"common":null}